{"access":"public","aliases":[],"assertions":[],"claim_ids":[],"created_at":"2026-09-14T02:16:41Z","created_by_operation":"op_675772a436bd41d7bb645899d5f29408","id":"pg_70a693873f53598eae92ad08b2d77bef","maturity":"draft","page_type":"source","path":"pages/sources/maruakshay-miii-cli-changelog-md-0a712d9f2d68-ad08b2d77bef.md","record_type":"page","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","source_ids":["src_b132aee314005fc6aec03462ce57f263"],"title":"maruakshay/miii-cli/CHANGELOG.md @ 0a712d9f2d68","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:16:41Z","updated_by_operation":"op_675772a436bd41d7bb645899d5f29408"}
{"access":"public","aliases":[],"assertions":[{"claim_ids":["clm_015d9311a3c7d0f494195148097418c2e38216355fd50d2d9df6823d17301dd4"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The tool requires Node 18 or newer and Ollama, and is distributed as the npm package miii-agent."},{"claim_ids":["clm_0d46e7893c507521421fae6db105bdf2cb65ba526029dfe820d8e16d8d61f972"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The agent repairs malformed tool calls from small models and sizes its prompt to the model's context window, and a MIII.md file in the repo is read every turn to teach project conventions."},{"claim_ids":["clm_47e0a3693cdf4b5803d63499e9b3b036fdc0155079da584746be22a3bae2f439"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"File tools reject ../ traversal and absolute paths outside the workspace, while run_bash is not path-confined and is bounded only by the permission prompt."},{"claim_ids":["clm_5bb8339a525f232b1789181de9300440f42109a223e51726b4ac71a3ab0c1c0b"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Saved approval rules live in .miii/permissions.json per project (with an optional global ~/.miii/permissions.json), and sessions can be saved and resumed via /new and /sessions."},{"claim_ids":["clm_71db020bbd3913059e2e39478ff3b91b20476bf96f50e9f47f41f691d3345d68"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The product includes `miii doctor`, which grades the user's installed local models on real engineering tasks to check whether they can drive an agent."},{"claim_ids":["clm_8507b87c0fbe5a1bea32b5da0b1b64a9e902ea5fc29da90240584449cc439107"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Four permission modes cycle via shift+tab: normal, plan (read-only), auto-accept edits, and bypass; 'always' approvals save exact commands plus globs that never span command boundaries or match destructive programs."},{"claim_ids":["clm_8788b4ff918329fb1db305305d5e066e956a8b27f70667dc5de361a421a333ca"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Tool output over ~10K bytes is spilled to ~/.miii/output/<id>.txt with a head/tail preview inline; the model pages through the file with ranged reads and spill files are garbage-collected after 24 hours."},{"claim_ids":["clm_c42c0120ad210182b0a99d55f402b56119ddd26b3132858890aa43b95a634c2b"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Repository development practice: contributors clone the repo, run npm install && npm run dev, and use npm run build, npm run typecheck, npm test, and npm run eval (a regression gate powering miii doctor); npm run build && npm link runs the working tree as the global miii."},{"claim_ids":["clm_cc53973488d3af3a7d5ef5139cd7fa5f1176027f60bcd24e79fc937dd8d0fdcd"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The CLI exposes slash commands (/plan, /permissions, /models, /sessions, /compact, /copy, /clear, /exit), a command palette on '/', and keyboard shortcuts such as Shift+Tab for permission modes and Ctrl+V for image paste."},{"claim_ids":["clm_d864208656c219dba9bf6098875b0b273af5369e56538de528e888b4d34ff782"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"miii is a local terminal AI coding agent that runs against Ollama with no API keys or cloud, positioned as an offline alternative to cloud coding assistants."},{"claim_ids":["clm_eaaa84747daa921a19272b09fbbaf34be6318692c9dbbee2d887a8b860f04ebc"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Besides Ollama, miii can talk to any OpenAI-compatible local server such as llama.cpp, LM Studio, or vLLM, selected via config providers or --provider at launch."},{"claim_ids":["clm_f27c42c8ce85e6ab374d2c3e35cb02b98de5e69d2a04290925a6703d95af998a"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Built-in agent tools include read_file, write_file, edit_file, glob, grep, run_bash, and write_todos for tracking multi-step work."},{"claim_ids":["clm_f44125e1bc73a93e9e2034bd71bdcb86376fe7b3ccc3b5ccf612c2ab1f5f3f82"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Custom slash commands are Markdown files in .miii/commands/ (project scope) or ~/.miii/commands/ (personal), supporting $ARGUMENTS and $1-$9 substitution, with project commands shadowing personal ones but never built-ins."}],"claim_ids":["clm_015d9311a3c7d0f494195148097418c2e38216355fd50d2d9df6823d17301dd4","clm_0d46e7893c507521421fae6db105bdf2cb65ba526029dfe820d8e16d8d61f972","clm_47e0a3693cdf4b5803d63499e9b3b036fdc0155079da584746be22a3bae2f439","clm_5bb8339a525f232b1789181de9300440f42109a223e51726b4ac71a3ab0c1c0b","clm_71db020bbd3913059e2e39478ff3b91b20476bf96f50e9f47f41f691d3345d68","clm_8507b87c0fbe5a1bea32b5da0b1b64a9e902ea5fc29da90240584449cc439107","clm_8788b4ff918329fb1db305305d5e066e956a8b27f70667dc5de361a421a333ca","clm_c42c0120ad210182b0a99d55f402b56119ddd26b3132858890aa43b95a634c2b","clm_cc53973488d3af3a7d5ef5139cd7fa5f1176027f60bcd24e79fc937dd8d0fdcd","clm_d864208656c219dba9bf6098875b0b273af5369e56538de528e888b4d34ff782","clm_eaaa84747daa921a19272b09fbbaf34be6318692c9dbbee2d887a8b860f04ebc","clm_f27c42c8ce85e6ab374d2c3e35cb02b98de5e69d2a04290925a6703d95af998a","clm_f44125e1bc73a93e9e2034bd71bdcb86376fe7b3ccc3b5ccf612c2ab1f5f3f82"],"created_at":"2026-09-14T02:16:41Z","created_by_operation":"op_675772a436bd41d7bb645899d5f29408","id":"pg_90c1922d4d65508a8b1633687960e4b6","maturity":"draft","page_type":"source","path":"pages/sources/maruakshay-miii-cli-readme-md-0a712d9f2d68-33687960e4b6.md","record_type":"page","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","source_ids":["src_e60d147462be5bbdbd24840007b0c4ef"],"title":"maruakshay/miii-cli/README.md @ 0a712d9f2d68","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:16:41Z","updated_by_operation":"op_675772a436bd41d7bb645899d5f29408"}
